## 5️⃣ TL;DR – What you need to change

```js
// ❌ Old
map.loadImage(url, (err, img) => {
  if (err) throw err;
  map.addImage('pin', img);
});

// ✅ New (async/await)
map.on('load', async () => {
  const { data } = await map.loadImage(url);
  map.addImage('pin', data);
});
```

*Make sure the style you use has a proper `sprite` URL, or add your own image and reference it via a Symbol layer or an HTML marker.* Once those two steps are done, the marker icons will appear again.

